From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:43:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1791/3799] soh: rename func_8002881C ->
 EffectSsDust_SpawnDrawFlags0Default

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: calls EffectSsDust_SpawnDrawFlags0 with the default scale 100 and scale step 5.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_effect_soft_sprite_old_init.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                      | 4 ++--
 soh/src/code/z_effect_soft_sprite_old_init.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index a61c1431d..31342aa86 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -253,8 +253,8 @@ void EffectSsDust_SpawnBrown4ScaledLife(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velo
                    s16 life);  // was func_8002873C [LLM:HIGH]
 void EffectSsDust_SpawnBrown5ScaledLife(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* accel, s16 scale, s16 scaleStep,
                    s16 life);  // was func_800287AC [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_8002881C(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* accel, Color_RGBA8* primColor,
-                   Color_RGBA8* envColor);
+void EffectSsDust_SpawnDrawFlags0Default(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* accel, Color_RGBA8* primColor,
+                   Color_RGBA8* envColor);  // was func_8002881C [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80028858(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* accel, Color_RGBA8* primColor,
                    Color_RGBA8* envColor);
 void func_80028990(PlayState* play, f32 randScale, Vec3f* srcPos);
diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_effect_soft_sprite_old_init.c b/soh/src/code/z_effect_soft_sprite_old_init.c
index da09d29b1..fed1b1c19 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_effect_soft_sprite_old_init.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_effect_soft_sprite_old_init.c
@@ -176,7 +176,8 @@ void EffectSsDust_SpawnBrown5ScaledLife(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velo
 }
 
 // unused
-void func_8002881C(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* accel, Color_RGBA8* primColor,
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8002881C: calls EffectSsDust_SpawnDrawFlags0 with the default scale 100 and scale step 5.
+void EffectSsDust_SpawnDrawFlags0Default(PlayState* play, Vec3f* pos, Vec3f* velocity, Vec3f* accel, Color_RGBA8* primColor,
                    Color_RGBA8* envColor) {
     EffectSsDust_SpawnDrawFlags0(play, pos, velocity, accel, primColor, envColor, 100, 5);  // was func_8002829C [LLM:HIGH]
 }
